  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wan Zi Hong is angry that she lacks most of her offensive Immortal Gu and has been reduced to healing. Ye Lui Kou’s aura surges as he prepares another killer move. Ye Lui Kou succeeds in killing Wan Zi Hong, but is also heavily injured by Zhao Shan He.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wan_zi_hong",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is quite fat, with light colored skin, and smiles with a satisfied look after eating Ye Lui Kou’s golden killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a later battlefield he is again pale and chubby.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Western Desert Immortal Gu House field he is a food path Gu Immortal. He looks at Yu Zhu Zi, who cultivates earth path. Yu Zhu Zi nods, they gather together, and the other Heavenly Court Gu Immortals surround and defend them. They unleash a move together: Sitting and Eating the Mountain Empty. It envelops the battlefield. Western Desert’s Immortal Gu Houses cannot dodge. After it is used, starlight pillars flash and all of the Heavenly Court rank eights leave. Gu worms in the houses weaken and die, and immortal essence beads inside start to disintegrate. Western Desert’s immortals guess food path correctly, and treat Zhao Shan He as a food path expert on Heavenly Court’s side. They judge that if Heavenly Court can keep giving him and Yu Zhu Zi the chance to use this move, Western Desert will lose strength and resources over time.",
      "chapters": [
        1925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "joint-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
